WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.446
<v Narrator>Your investigation has reached the Boardroom. Senior leaders now have something to lose.

2
00:00:06.146 --> 00:00:15.446
<v Chidi Okafor>Let's not turn this into a witch hunt. Performance is everything in this market. You slow down, you lose the contract, you lose the jobs.

3
00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:20.688
<v Chidi Okafor>Everyone signed off on the budget. This is not about ethics, it's about being realistic.

